  <data name="ServicesPageTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Services &amp; Packs</value></data>
  <data name="ServicesIntro" xml:space="preserve"><value>What started as a weekend hobby became a passion: trying to capture that perfect angle, the reflection on the paint or the detail only true car lovers notice. I'm not a big advertising company — it's just me, my camera and the will to photograph incredible machines. If you have a car you cherish and would like some great photos of it to remember (or for Instagram!), just say the word.</value></data>
  <data name="ServicesQuote" xml:space="preserve"><value>The best love is the kind that awakens the soul and makes us reach for more, that plants a fire in our hearts and brings peace to our minds.</value></data>
  <data name="ServicesQuoteAuthor" xml:space="preserve"><value>— Nicholas Sparks</value></data>
  <data name="PricingTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>PRICES &amp; FORMATS</value></data>
  <data name="Nr01Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>events</value></data>
  <data name="Nr01Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>If you were at an event, meet or trackday with your car and saw me around with a camera, chances are I have photos of your car. Photos can be purchased individually or in digital packs, already edited and ready to share on social media.</value></data>
  <data name="Nr01Price" xml:space="preserve"><value>From €3</value></data>
  <data name="Nr01Cta" xml:space="preserve"><value>Request Photos</value></data>
  <data name="Nr02Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>sessions</value></data>
  <data name="Nr02Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>A photo session dedicated entirely to your car, at a location of your choice. We take it slow, looking for the best angles and making the most of the ideal light to highlight every line, the paint and the details that make your project unique.</value></data>
  <data name="Nr02Price" xml:space="preserve"><value>From €45</value></data>
  <data name="Nr02Cta" xml:space="preserve"><value>Book a Session</value></data>
  <data name="Nr03Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>STANDS</value></data>
  <data name="Nr03Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Photography focused on car dealerships and businesses in the sector. Clean, professional images of exteriors, interiors and mechanical details — essential to showcase vehicles in ads and help speed up sales.</value></data>
  <data name="Nr03Price" xml:space="preserve"><value>From €35 / car</value></data>
